{"id": "56932", "title": "被豢养的罂粟（爸爸哥哥，不要了）", "author": "草草鸟事", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 30, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/56/56932.htm", "intro": "似乎这世间女子梦想被豢养的罂粟拥有的一切都同时出现在了她的身上。她不仅仅拥有绝美的外貌，而且拥有着常人不可及的聪慧，家世显耀至极。甄家的男人们是没有人敢去得罪的，谁不知道只要是涉及到甄欣的事，甄家的男人们就更为疯狂。即使是在豪门巨富子女云集的英华学院，她也是当之无愧的女皇。即使是这样，她丝毫没有盛气凌人的架子，有的只有恬静与淡然。", "base": "files/article/html/56/56932", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子--脸红心跳", "file": "8013494.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1-5", "file": "8013496.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "8013497.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "8013498.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "8013499.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "8013500.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "8013501.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "8013502.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "8013504.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "8013506.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "8013507.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "8013509.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-61", "file": "8013511.html", "available": false}, {"title": "62-70", "file": "8013514.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-80", "file": "8013517.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-91", "file": "8013519.html", "available": false}, {"title": "92-103", "file": "8013520.html", "available": false}, {"title": "104-115", "file": "8013521.html", "available": false}, {"title": "116-126", "file": "8013522.html", "available": false}, {"title": "127-137", "file": "8013525.html", "available": false}, {"title": "138-147", "file": "8013527.html", "available": false}, {"title": "148-158", "file": "8013529.html", "available": false}, {"title": "159-171", "file": "8013536.html", "available": false}, {"title": "172-183", "file": "8013543.html", "available": false}, {"title": "184-195", "file": "8